  "releaseNotes": "1.5.2 - README tidy-up, no code change. 1.5.1 - Settings switch and telemetry toggle use the backoffice UI components (uui-tab-group, uui-toggle). 1.5.0 - SECURITY: the Count Things API now requires a signed-in backoffice user (up to 1.4.4 anyone could read a site's counts). Adds an anonymous daily telemetry heartbeat (random install ID, versions, size bands; on by default, off in the dashboard Settings tab or with CountThings:Telemetry:Enabled = false). See the README.",
